	(text_box "The followoing signals need to be routed using a 50 Ohm coplanar microstrip or stripline impedance profile:\n\nCMD, CLK, D0, D1, D2, D3.\n\nThe calculations for trace width have been made according to the manufacturing specs listed in the main architecture sheet of this PCB and assuming a coplanar routing approach (0.1mm clearance to GND).\n\nNote that the signal layers of this PCB are Layer 1, 4 and 6 and the reference layers are Layer 2 and 5. If this is changed, the trace width has to be recalculated.\n\nThe results of the JLCPCB online impedance caluclator are the following:\n\nLayer 1 trace width = 0.1199 mm\nLayer 4 trace width = 0.2149 mm\nLayer 6 trace width = 0.1199 mm\n\nThe impedance profiles will only be accurate if the following aspects are specified when ordering:\n\nLayers = 6\nInner copper weight = 0.5oz\nOuter copper weight = 1oz\nPCB thickness = 1.6mm\nManufacturer = JLCPCB\nStack-up Code = JLC0616H-3313A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 92.6592 0)
		(size -45.72 88.9)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5014cfff-9fb1-4ab2-9fb2-29f4ca36dd3f")
	)
	(text_box "Keep SDMMC traces below 120mm.\n\nAvoid using vias on SDMMC signals, if necessary, use the same number of vias for all signals.\n\nLength match the following signals to <10 mm:\n\nCMD, CLK, D0, D1, D2, D3, length matched to each other (SDMMC net class)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 29.1592 0)
		(size -45.72 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c2d54e6-060d-4215-8774-ddb48b6cda02")
	)
	(text_box "Create a ground plane beneath the SD card connector with the SD_Shield net.\n\nTerminate ESD protection diodes to SD_Shield plane.\n\nBond SD_Shield to GND using ferrite beads at a single bonding point."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 64.7192 0)
		(size -45.72 22.86)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
